   "about": "Reports developments in Japanese agriculture, fisheries, forestry, mining, coal, and petroleum.",
   "summary": "The summary describes Japan’s new agricultural extension system and introduces attached cooperative and fertilizer documents. Its fisheries section includes a visiting mission’s extended assessment of conservation, fishing boundaries, international obligations, research, and Japanese industry, followed by wage, whaling, and fuel allocation data. Forestry, mining, metallurgy, coal, and petroleum sections report production, stocks, mine safety, and oil exploration, with supporting tables and a press release list.",
